    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        KSI SNOMED CT 160943002 (own home as a residence/housing category) matches (@sv: bor i egen bostad)
        — same concept of owning/occupying one's own home; KSI is the setting, SNOMED CT is the
        living-status finding, near-identical scope. High tier exact on the home-ownership/residence
        axis; not because KSI is a location/setting and SNOMED CT is the residence status finding.
        """
}
