        Source YAE SNOMED CT 229062007 = measures/interventions under financial assistance per the Social
        Services Act (SoL) — the top-level Swedish social-services category for means-tested cash
        assistance (income support/subsistence grants) to households. Target SNOMED CT 4045288
        (concept_code 229062007) =, a patient-circumstance finding denoting receipt of income-support
        benefit. Broader (target subsumes source): income support is the general concept; SoL economic
        assistance is one Swedish statutory form of it. Weak : the source is an administrative/legal
        assistance-program category (a service type delivered by social services), the target is a
        patient-circumstance benefit-receipt finding; only a loose overlap is defensible and the SNOMED CT
        term carries no SoL/statutory dimension.
        """
}
